 "camera": {
  "about": "A camera pocket: free floor in front of a face at a named place. From the scene tool's speaker rule (read, not imported): a speaker's head within 45 degrees of the camera; a talk face at least 0.10 of the frame height in a medium and 0.18 in a close; a 36 mm wide sensor, 20 mm high at 1152x640; lenses 28 to 100 mm. With a face about 0.24 m high the face size sets only a far limit (3.4 m at 28 mm for a medium, 1.9 m for a close; further with a longer lens), so the near limit is what a room can fail: the lens needs room to hold chest-up (medium) or head-and-shoulders (close) at 28 mm.",
  "head_deg": 40.0,
  "angle_steps": 9,
  "framings": {
   "close": [
